      solution: `$\\vec{u} \\cdot \\vec{v} = ${a} \\times ${b} \\times ${cTex.startsWith("-") ? `\\left(${cTex}\\right)` : cTex} = ${bonne}$, soit environ $${nb(+(P * cv).toFixed(2))}$.`
