        solution: somme ? `$(f_1 + f_2)' = (${edoCo(a)}f_1 ${plus(f)}) + (${edoCo(a)}f_2 ${plus(f)}) = ${edoCo(a)}(f_1 + f_2) ${plus(f2)}$ : $f_1 + f_2$ est solution de $y' = ${edoCo(a)}y ${plus(f2)}$ (et non de $(E)$).` : `$(f_1 - f_2)' = (${edoCo(a)}f_1 ${plus(f)}) - (${edoCo(a)}f_2 ${plus(f)}) = ${edoCo(a)}(f_1 - f_2)$ : $f_1 - f_2$ est solution de l'équation sans second membre $y' = ${edoCo(a)}y$.`
